00:08:06,520 --> 00:08:07,340
Two flat dimensions.

187
00:08:07,560 --> 00:08:07,740
Right.

188
00:08:07,980 --> 00:08:11,680
So what is the fiber over those specific coordinates?

189
00:08:11,920 --> 00:08:16,640
The fiber is the actual living territory you would experience if you were standing there.

190
00:08:16,720 --> 00:08:19,140
It's the altitude, which the flat map ignores.

191
00:08:19,140 --> 00:08:21,060
Because altitude is the third dimension.

192
00:08:21,220 --> 00:08:21,360
Right.

193
00:08:21,460 --> 00:08:24,680
It's the subsurface tectonic plates grinding beneath your feet.

194
00:08:24,780 --> 00:08:27,840
It's the biological activity of the oak tree growing on that spot.

195
00:08:28,000 --> 00:08:29,900
The microscopic organisms in the dirt.

196
00:08:30,080 --> 00:08:30,380
Yes.

197
00:08:30,600 --> 00:08:33,380
The humidity in the air, the temperature, all of it.

198
00:08:33,760 --> 00:08:34,160
Exactly.

199
00:08:34,440 --> 00:08:39,720
All of those things, the dirt, the tree, the humidity, they are accessible if you are

200
00:08:39,720 --> 00:08:41,340
