00:18:20,180 --> 00:18:22,040
your life no longer apply.

416
00:18:22,720 --> 00:18:23,640
Or what about physics?

417
00:18:24,300 --> 00:18:29,300
In physics, think of a cosmological singularity, like the center of a black hole.

