00:19:39,520 --> 00:19:39,640
Yeah.

441
00:19:40,000 --> 00:19:40,860
But think about it this way.

442
00:19:41,520 --> 00:19:44,260
A constraint doesn't just limit, it defines.

443
00:19:44,660 --> 00:19:44,920
Okay.

444
00:19:45,280 --> 00:19:50,740
Imagine you are floating in an infinite, purely white, undifferentiated void.

445
00:19:51,360 --> 00:19:53,580
You can move in any direction infinitely.

446
00:19:53,820 --> 00:19:54,060
Okay.

