00:41:48,960 --> 00:41:58,780
Flixion proposes that the fabric of the universe is a structured plenum of nested constraint regions, deeply analogous to a gigantic, infinite sphere pop diagram.

921
00:41:58,960 --> 00:42:00,980
So the whole universe is just nested bubbles.

