00:42:53,480 --> 00:42:59,320
It drops the depth hierarchy of a localized region of space to relieve thermodynamic tension.

931
00:42:59,460 --> 00:43:03,680
So the math you do on a piece of paper using sphere pop bubbles isn't just a metaphor for physics.

