00:43:03,840 --> 00:43:08,900
No. It is structurally identical to the thermodynamics of the cosmos. As above, so below.

933
00:43:08,900 --> 00:43:14,920
The macroscopic universe and the microscopic cognitive thought are both just constraint engines popping boundaries.

934
00:43:15,400 --> 00:43:23,180
My mind is thoroughly expanded and possibly slightly melted. What an unbelievable journey this text has taken us on.

